### Create a transaction
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 2500.00,
  "category": "Salary",
  "description": "June pay",
  "date": "2026-06-29",
  "type": "INCOME"
}

### Get all transactions
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions

### Get summary
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/summary

### Get by ID (change the number)
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/1

### Delete by ID (change the number)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/transactions/1

### Test validation - missing amount
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Groceries",
  "date": "2026-06-29",
  "type": "EXPENSE"
}

### Test validation errors
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "",
  "type": "EXPENSE"
}

### Test 404
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/999

### Update a transaction (change the id)
PUT http://localhost:8080/transactions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 2600.00,
  "category": "Salary",
  "description": "June pay - corrected",
  "date": "2026-06-29",
  "type": "INCOME"
}

### Delete a non-existent transaction
DELETE http://localhost:8080/transactions/999